ower, 5 done \u25cf\u200bAppendix G: Developing Agents with Google ADK, 17 -  final  done \u25cf\u200bAppendix H: Leveraging Gemini to Redesign the Search UX, 15 - final  done \u25cf\u200bAppendix I: Guide to Google Antigravity, 8- final  done \u25cf\u200bAppendix L: Google Deep Research, 4 - final done \u25cf\u200bFurther Reading & Online Resources, 8 -  final check done \u25cf\u200bGlossary, 12 -  final check done \u25cf\u200bConclusion, 2  -  final check done ",
